# Shortxx Admin — environment notes

No build-time secrets required. The dashboard talks to Firestore directly
with the Firebase web config below — same project the public site uses.

- `firebase-applet-config.json` — Firebase web config for project
  `shortxx-live` (apiKey, projectId, storageBucket, ...). Ships with the
  repo; these are public client keys, NOT admin secrets. Do not delete.
- No `GEMINI_API_KEY`, no server-side env: this is a static SPA
  (`npm run build` -> `dist/`, served by Netlify). There is no Express
  server anymore (removed 2026-09-25 — AI Studio applet leftover whose
  `/api/videos/*` endpoints had zero consumers and a stale field contract).

Local dev:
  npm install
  npm run dev     # Vite on http://localhost:5173
